The DFG screenshots in this folder are all generated from Disco. 
The reassignments data corresponds to the “Number of Reassignments” column in the original dataset. 
All DFG from Disco Map function, the configuration is set to paths = 0 and activities = 100% with corresponding filter. 
The applied filter selects cases based on the corresponding number of reassignments, as categorized using the data_process_v1.ipynb. 
The resulting CSV files from data_process_v1.ipynb. were then uploaded to Disco for analysis.
